   507                                      ; IBM AT shutdown 09h deliberately bypasses PIC reinitialization.  Windows
   508                                      ; 3.1 uses this older, widely-compatible mode-switch return by default.
   509                                      ; The original AT path also forces the keyboard-controller A20 gate low
   510                                      ; before resuming and enables maskable interrupts.  Windows relies on that
   511                                      ; complete firmware contract even though it immediately manages both states
