  1434                                  ; Runtime keyboard helpers ---------------------------------------------------
  1435                                  ; These helpers operate with DS = BDA_SEG.  They use the same physical
  1436                                  ; controller/keyboard command path POST used; no host-side state is consulted.
  1437                                  
  1438                                  ; AL = byte to send to the keyboard.  Wait for ACK, retry on RESEND.
  1439                                  ; Returns CF set on timeout/error.  Keyboard command responses bypass the
  1440                                  ; 8042 scan-code translator in Keyboard Reality Brick 2.
