  4866                                  ; Cromwell AT CMOS Setup
  4867                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  4868                                  ; The setup program lives in the system ROM, as it did on late AT-compatible
  4869                                  ; motherboards. CMOS byte 20h is OEM configuration RAM covered by the normal
  4870                                  ; 10h-20h checksum: bit 0 is boot Num Lock and bit 1 selects HDD-first boot.
